    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this true gem of a home, No. 190 Ashlawn Park.\r\n\r\nOffering a superb high energy rating of BER B this wonderful property has been beautifully modernised and maintained throughout combining contemporary décor with a warm and welcoming family atmosphere. Conveniently positioned within the mature and established residential setting of Ashlawn Park this generous and attractive home is within easy walking distance of local shops, church and the expansive green spaces of Kilbogget Park. The property is sure to appeal to first time buyers, young families and those looking for a well appointed home.\r\n\r\nThe property makes an excellent first impression with its low-maintenance front garden, off-street parking and manicured hedging providing both privacy and kerb appeal. A compact porch with sliding doors leads into the welcoming entrance hall where clever understairs storage provides a practical use of space. The laminate wood flooring continues into the spacious sitting room which benefits from a large front facing window filling the room with natural light while an open fireplace creates a warm and inviting focal point.\r\n\r\nAt the rear of the property lies the heart of this home; a bright and practical open-plan kitchen and dining area. The kitchen features attractive Shaker-style fitted units, built-in cooking appliances and a tiled floor with ample space for comfortable family dining. From here there is direct access to the rear garden as well as the adjoining utility room. This particularly useful, bonus area incorporates a guest WC, dedicated home office space and access to the garage.\r\n\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the excellent standard of presentation continues. The landing provides access to the hot press and three well proportioned bedrooms comprising two spacious doubles and one single bedroom. Both double bedrooms feature built-in wardrobes; positioned to the front and rear of the property with benefiting from dual window allowing plenty of natural light to flood in. All bedrooms have carpet flooring creating a cosy and comfortable feel throughout. Completing the accommodation is a fully tiled family bathroom fitted with a three-piece suite and an electric shower over the bath.\r\n\r\nOutside, the rear garden has been designed with ease of maintenance in mind featuring paving and raised planted borders. A garden shed which is neatly positioned at the back of the garden provides useful additional storage while making excellent use of the available space.\r\n\r\nNo. 190 Ashlawn Park enjoys a superb selection of amenities on its doorstep. Sports enthusiasts are particularly well catered for with a variety of local clubs and facilities catering for GAA, soccer, rugby and tennis. The nearby Kilbogget Park with lush acres of green gives an ideal setting for walking, jogging and enjoying the outdoors. \r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from excellent transport links with bus routes available on Churchview Road, easy access to the QBC on the N11 and convenient road connections to the N11 and M50. The DART is also readily accessible from nearby Killiney where you will also find the beach. Established schools both primary and secondary surround this wonderful home. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
